Description: AI Robotics IDE for STM32, ESP32 and ROS 2
 RoboAgent is an AI-native robotics IDE built on Visual Studio Code. It adds
 a Mode selector with Create / Build / Debug for STM32 firmware, ESP-IDF
 projects and ROS 2 workspaces, a ROS 2 package explorer and node graph, and
 bundles the ESP-IDF extension.
 See https://github.com/Mohamedsaied8/RoboAgent for installation
 instructions.
